{'symbol': 'IQV', 'date': '2023-05-11 11:00:00', 'title': "IQVIA CELEBRATES SHEETAL TELANG, WINNER OF HEALTHCARE BUSINESSWOMAN'S ASSOCIATION RISING STAR AWARD", 'text': "RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IQVIA (NYSE:IQV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SHEETAL TELANG, VICE PRESIDENT OF THERAPEUTIC STRATEGY, HAS BEEN HONORED WITH THE 2023 RISING STAR AWARD BY THE HEALTHCARE BUSINESSWOMAN'S ASSOCIATION (HBA). SHEETAL EARNED THE AWARD FOR HER STRONG AND INNOVATIVE LEADERSHIP, COMBINED WITH HER EXEMPLARY WORK IN IQVIA'S CLINICAL DEVELOPMENT BUSINESS. SHEETAL HAS CONSISTENTLY BEEN AT THE FOREFRONT OF CRITICAL INDUSTRY INITIATIVES, SUCH AS REDUCING THE BURDEN FOR P."}